    { "q": "What happens if something fails between visits?", "a": "We offer same-day emergency response, which matters most for clients who cannot be without water or whose systems carry a compliance risk. Being on a contract means we already know your system when you call, so we can act quickly and with the right parts in mind. The aim is to keep any interruption as short as possible." },
